# Only the static site (index.html + catalog.js) needs to ship. Keep the big
# local cache and scratch dirs out of the Vercel upload.
#
# .vercelignore is the only list Vercel reads - it does NOT honour .gitignore.
# .claude/ is gitignored, which hid it locally while Vercel published it: both
# .claude/settings.local.json and .claude/skills/**/SKILL.md were serving 200
# in production. Anything meant to stay private has to be named here too.
.claude/
data_cache/
.playwright-mcp/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
file_profiles.prev.json
requirements.txt
*.py
sources.yaml
data_files.yaml
